OL,3,GNEWSACricketers banned over
OL,4,A'irresponsible' fireworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA national cricket organisation has
OL,7,Fbeen banned from a club after setting
OL,8,Foff fireworks days after a UK-wide
OL,9,Fwildfire alert was issued.
OL,11,FThe Cricket Players' Association of
OL,12,FMoulvibazar United Kingdom (CPAM UK),
OL,13,Fwhich promotes British Bangladeshi
OL,14,Fcricket, held its annual City Cup
OL,15,Ftournament at Cheltenham Cricket Club
OL,16,F(CCC) on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
