OL,3,GNEWSACricketers banned over
OL,4,A'irresponsible' fireworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA club spokesperson said it was
OL,7,F"irresponsible and completely
OL,8,Funacceptable" for fireworks to be set
OL,9,Foff, and said the organisation has been
OL,10,Fbanned from using its ground in the
OL,11,Ffuture.
OL,13,FCPAM UK has said it takes the concerns
OL,14,F"very seriously" and is "reviewing the
OL,15,Fcircumstances surrounding the event".
